{"id":"53a09185ea2d54ba","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation.md","title":"完整一阶语汇版本的 Craig 插值","display":"thm-first-order-craig-interpolation — 完整一阶语汇版本的 Craig 插值","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation","aliases":["72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation"],"display":"thm-first-order-craig-interpolation — 完整一阶语汇版本的 Craig 插值","depends_on":["[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I Craig Interpolation Theorem(a), §2.5.5, print56/PDF68","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source theorem statement checked; complete quantifier-case proof not reproduced","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-first-order-craig-interpolation — 完整一阶语汇版本的 Craig 插值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3fdc9eba98ce09ac\" href=\"?note=3fdc9eba98ce09ac\" title=\"72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant\">72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I Craig Interpolation Theorem(a), §2.5.5, print56/PDF68"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source theorem statement checked; complete quantifier-case proof not reproduced"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A、B∈<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>，语法含显式 ⊤、⊥；CInt 与 Valid 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fdc9eba98ce09ac\" href=\"?note=3fdc9eba98ce09ac\" title=\"72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant\">72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant</a>。Σ 允许任意有限元数的常元、函数、关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Valid}(A\\to B)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists C\\in X_\\Sigma\\ \\operatorname{CInt}_\\Sigma(C;A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Valid}(A\\to B)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists C\\in X_\\Sigma\\ \\operatorname{CInt}_\\Sigma(C;A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节点补出原书完整一阶版本，区别于旧文件中仅对命题 Frege 系统陈述的插值实例。⊤、⊥ 使公共语汇为空时仍能给插值。原书通过分割相继式的消切归纳说明证明方向；本轮核对陈述、语汇及逻辑等号语义，未独立补齐全部量词归纳分支。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant","status":"resolved","id":"3fdc9eba98ce09ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant","status":"resolved","id":"3fdc9eba98ce09ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"A、B∈$X_\\Sigma$，语法含显式 ⊤、⊥；CInt 与 Valid 取 [[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]]。Σ 允许任意有限元数的常元、函数、关系。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Valid}(A\\to B)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists C\\in X_\\Sigma\\ \\operatorname{CInt}_\\Sigma(C;A,B).","display":true}],"bytes":1527,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]] · [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]] · [[72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel]] · [[72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation]] · [[72-thm-partitioned-sequent-interpolation]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-479","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]] · [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]] · [[72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel]] · [[72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation]] · [[72-thm-partitioned-sequent-interpolation]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-474","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]] · [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]] · [[72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel]] · [[72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation]] · [[72-thm-partitioned-sequent-interpolation]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]] · [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]] · [[72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel]] · [[72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation]] · [[72-thm-partitioned-sequent-interpolation]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-474","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]] · [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]] · [[72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel]] · [[72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation]] · [[72-thm-partitioned-sequent-interpolation]]"},{"id":"5d6d95eb13748e1d","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-